====== D-Link DWR-922 ======
DWR-922 is a wireless router with QMI LTE embedded modem. It is pretty much identical to the [[toh:d-link:dwr-921|D-Link DWR 921 C1/C3]].
The DWR-922 only appears to differ from the DWR-921 in that there is an analogue RJ11 phone socket (not sure if supported, I didn't try), and the associated components on the board, which is unpopulated on the 921 board. This phone interface appears to also be used in the [[toh:d-link:dwr-512_b|D-Link DWR-512]].

The E2 hardware revision is the only one I have tested.

